来一个深色渐变风格的：

```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
  body { min-height: 100vh; font: 16px/1.6 -apple-system, "PingFang SC", sans-serif; color: #e8e6f0;
         background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 20% -10%, #4a3c8c 0%, transparent 60%),
                     radial-gradient(900px 500px at 90% 10%, #2a2f6a 0%, transparent 55%), #14132a; }
  nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
  nav b { font-size: 20px; } nav b span { color: #a78bfa; }
  nav a { color: #cfcbe6; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 22px; font-size: 14px; }
  .hero { text-align: center; padding: 80px 24px 40px; }
  .avatar { width: 112px; height: 112px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 30px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 48px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b7cf6, #5b4fd6); box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(139,124,246,.15), 0 20px 60px rgba(91,79,214,.5); animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes float { 50% { transform: translateY(-8px); } }
  h1 { font-size: 40px; letter-spacing: -.01em; } h1 span { color: #a78bfa; }
  .hero p { color: #b8b4d0; margin-top: 12px; }
  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; max-width: 760px; margin: 60px auto 0; padding: 0 24px; }
  .card { background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 14px; padding: 26px 0; text-align: center; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
  .card b { display: block; font-size: 30px; color: #a78bfa; } .card small { color: #b8b4d0; }
  h2 { max-width: 760px; margin: 60px auto 0; padding: 0 24px; border-left: 3px solid #a78bfa; padding-left: 14px; }
  .skills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; max-width: 760px; margin: 24px auto 80px; padding: 0 24px; }
  .skills div { background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; }
  .bar { height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); margin-top: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #a78bfa, #60a5fa); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav><b>Dev<span>.Portfolio</span></b><div><a href="#">首页</a><a href="#">技能</a><a href="#">项目</a><a href="#">联系</a></div></nav>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="avatar">🧑‍💻</div>
  <h1>你好，我是 <span>小明</span></h1>
  <p>一名热爱创造的前端开发者，专注于构建美观、流畅的用户体验。</p>
</section>
<section class="stats">
  <div class="card"><b>5</b><small>年经验</small></div>
  <div class="card"><b>42</b><small>完成项目</small></div>
  <div class="card"><b>18</b><small>Happy 客户</small></div>
  <div class="card"><b>3.2k</b><small>提交代码</small></div>
</section>
<h2>技能</h2>
<section class="skills">
  <div>HTML / CSS<div class="bar"><i style="width:92%"></i></div></div>
  <div>JavaScript<div class="bar"><i style="width:85%"></i></div></div>
  <div>Vue / React<div class="bar"><i style="width:78%"></i></div></div>
</section>
</body>
</html>
```

保存为 index.html 直接打开即可。
